### 1. Generate a fresh signed request:
###    bun run examples/wordpress-webhook/sign-request.ts
### 2. Paste its x-hooka-timestamp and x-hooka-signature headers below, and
###    replace the body with its `rawBody` string exactly as printed (one line).
###    The signature covers `${timestamp}.${rawBody}` byte for byte, and the
###    timestamp must be within five minutes of the server clock.
###    Or run the printed `curl` command instead.
POST http://localhost:3000/api/webhooks/task
content-type: application/json
x-hooka-timestamp: <timestamp from sign-request.ts>
x-hooka-signature: sha256=<signature from sign-request.ts>

<rawBody from sign-request.ts>
